{
	"title": "Ajustement par changement de variable z = ln(y)",
	"description": "Ajustement affine de z = ln(y) donné : calculer un zᵢ, revenir à y = e^b × e^(ax), estimer y ou un seuil en x (pièges : oubli de l'exponentielle, e^b non calculé, x non entier)",
	"grades": [
		"T_COMP"
	],
	"points": [
		"TCOMP-119",
		"TCOMP-124",
		"TCOMP-120"
	],
	"theme": "Statistiques",
	"domain": "Statistique à deux variables",
	"subdomain": "Changement de variable",
	"level": 2,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 60,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "On étudie une série $(x_i\\,;y_i)$ dont le nuage a une allure exponentielle. On pose $z_i=\\ln(y_i)$.\n\nCalcule $z_i$ pour $y_i={{y}}$. Donne la valeur arrondie au centième.\n\n$z_i\\approx ?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "y",
					"expression": "11..600"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"abs(100*ln(y)-floor(100*ln(y))-0.5) > 0.05",
				"mod(round(100*ln(y)), 10) != 0"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:round(100*ln(y))/100;d}}",
					"precision": {
						"type": "decimal",
						"digits": 2
					}
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$z_i=\\ln({{y}})\\approx \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:round(100*ln(y))/100;d}}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Pour une série $(x_i\\,;y_i)$, on a posé $z=\\ln(y)$, et la calculatrice donne l'ajustement affine $z={{eval:A/100;d}}x+{{eval:B/100;d}}$.\n\nEstime $y$ pour $x={{x0}}$. Donne la valeur arrondie à l'unité.\n\n$y\\approx ?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "A",
					"expression": "5..30"
				},
				{
					"name": "B",
					"expression": "100..300"
				},
				{
					"name": "x0",
					"expression": "5..15"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "{{eval:exp(A*x0/100+B/100)}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"abs(r-floor(r)-0.5) > 0.05",
				"r < 5000"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:round(r)}}",
					"precision": {
						"type": "decimal",
						"digits": 0
					}
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Pour $x={{x0}}$ : $z={{eval:A/100;d}}\\times {{x0}}+{{eval:B/100;d}}={{eval:A*x0/100+B/100;d}}$.",
					"Comme $z=\\ln(y)$, $y=e^{z}=e^{ {{eval:A*x0/100+B/100;d}} }\\approx \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:round(r)}}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Pour une série $(x_i\\,;y_i)$, on a posé $z=\\ln(y)$, et la calculatrice donne l'ajustement affine $z={{eval:A/100;d}}x+{{eval:B/100;d}}$. On en déduit une expression de la forme $y=k\\,e^{ {{eval:A/100;d}}x}$.\n\nDonne la valeur de $k$ arrondie au dixième.\n\n$k\\approx ?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "A",
					"expression": "5..30"
				},
				{
					"name": "B",
					"expression": "50..400"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "{{eval:exp(B/100)}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"abs(10*r-floor(10*r)-0.5) > 0.05",
				"mod(round(10*r), 10) != 0"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:round(10*r)/10;d}}",
					"precision": {
						"type": "decimal",
						"digits": 1
					}
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$y=e^{z}=e^{ {{eval:A/100;d}}x+{{eval:B/100;d}} }=e^{ {{eval:B/100;d}} }\\times e^{ {{eval:A/100;d}}x}$.",
					"$k=e^{ {{eval:B/100;d}} }\\approx \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:round(10*r)/10;d}}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Pour une série $(x_i\\,;y_i)$, on a posé $z=\\ln(y)$, et la calculatrice donne l'ajustement affine $z={{eval:A/100;d}}x+{{eval:B/100;d}}$.\n\nSelon ce modèle, à partir de quelle valeur entière de $x$ a-t-on $y>{{y0}}$ ?\n\n$x=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "A",
					"expression": "10..30"
				},
				{
					"name": "B",
					"expression": "100..200"
				},
				{
					"name": "y0",
					"expression": "100|200|500|1000|2000"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "{{eval:(ln(y0)-B/100)/(A/100)}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"s > 1",
				"s - floor(s) > 0.05",
				"s - floor(s) < 0.95"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:floor(s)+1}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$y>{{y0}}\\iff z>\\ln({{y0}})\\iff {{eval:A/100;d}}x+{{eval:B/100;d}}>\\ln({{y0}})\\iff x>\\dfrac{\\ln({{y0}})-{{eval:B/100;d}} }{ {{eval:A/100;d}} }\\approx {{eval:round(100*s)/100;d}}$.",
					"Le plus petit entier qui convient est $x=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:floor(s)+1}}}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "v0 : ln(50) ≈ 3,91",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"y": "50"
			},
